From 1e62c6bee457a3e6e438e69ebb63cb45a5fcf551 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sitish <sitishjayaswal12@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 15:13:59 +0545
Subject: [PATCH] context: hand-off fixes: the socket lives in
 /run/greetd-handoff/<uid>.sock and is bound before the session starts; a
 session that dies during the hand-off aborts its socket task and the new
 greeter starts only after the old one exits; switch fallback 8 s; an outgoing
 user session at logout ends itself (no SIGTERM, no alarm kill)

---
 greetd/src/context.rs | 142 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------------
 1 file changed, 103 insertions(+), 39 deletions(-)

diff --git a/greetd/src/context.rs b/greetd/src/context.rs
index d73ae20..359910a 100644
